-> [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.flashing|Install OpenWrt (generic explanation)]]
==== Flashing ANY Firmware ====
  - You must set your TCP/IP v4 protocol to:
    * IP: 192.168.1.2
    * Netmask: 255.255.255.0
    * Gateway: 192.168.1.1
    * DNS: (optional, can be blank).
  - Power off the router.
  - Press reset button near the antenna.
  - Keep it pressed while powering up during ~20+ seconds.
  - Acces to ''%%http://192.168.1.1%%'', you should see this screen:\\ {{:media:doc:cfe63xx_web-upgrade.png?500|}} 
  - Upload the binary file.
  - Wait until router reboots.


==== OEM installation using the TFTP method ====

->  [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.flashing.tftp]]

